<GuideLayout 
  title="Private Label vs OEM Manufacturing: Which is Right for You?" 
  type="COMPARISON GUIDE"
  description="Which manufacturing strategy is right for your business stage? A deep dive into the pros and cons of Private Label and OEM models."
>
  <h2>Choosing the Right Manufacturing Model</h2>
  <p>Your choice between Private Label and OEM will depend on your budget, design capability, and desired time to market.</p>
  
  <h3>Private Label (The Fast Track)</h3>
  <p>Use our proven designs and apply your own branding. Best for quick launches and lower MOQs.</p>

  <h3>OEM (The Ultimate Customization)</h3>
  <p>Develop unique designs and proprietary fabrics from scratch. Best for established brands looking for absolute differentiation.</p>

  <h3>Summary Comparison</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Speed: Private Label is significantly faster.</li>
    <li>MOQ: Private Label typically has lower minimums.</li>
    <li>Customization: OEM offers unlimited possibilities.</li>
  </ul>
</GuideLayout>
